- Checkout now normalizes addresses and, when possible, auto-selects the cheapest carrier rate; if no profile exists it degrades gracefully to zero-cost shipping while preserving metadata for auditing (`modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/services/CheckoutSaga.java:146`). The Quarkus test harness stubs the shipping service so Saga tests remain deterministic (`modules/core-platform/src/test/java/villagecompute/storefront/services/CheckoutSagaTest.java:33`).
